00:26:46.370 --> 00:26:50.960
So now I'm going to create my
random force regressor that's

00:26:50.960 --> 00:26:52.730
performing my analysis.

00:26:52.730 --> 00:26:56.372
Now I will fit my model
with the training data.

00:26:56.372 --> 00:26:57.830
And once the model
is trained, it's

00:26:57.830 --> 00:27:01.980
